# "Sacrifice them at the beginning of the next end step" is done by Bot1, who can only sacrifice what Bot1 controls (CR 701.21a,
# 603.7c). Bot1's Devastating Onslaught (X=2) makes two Llanowar Elves tokens. Bot2, with five Moxen, then casts a Lightning
# Bolt and, in response, Sudden Substitution (split second), exchanging control of the Bolt and one Elves token: Bot2 now
# controls that token, Bot1 the Bolt (Bot1 chooses new targets and aims it at Bot2, 17). At the end step Bot1 sacrifices only the
# token it still controls; the one Bot2 holds stays on the battlefield under Bot2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Llanowar Elves
Devastating Onslaught
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Sudden Substitution
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Devastating Onslaught.Cast(Llanowar Elves; X: 2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves#2.Token = true
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#1.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#2.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Sudden Substitution.Cast
Bot2.Target(Stack.Lightning Bolt)
Bot2.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves#3)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Token = true
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Life = 17
[T3 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 17
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Emerald; Mox Ruby; Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Mox Sapphire; Llanowar Elves
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 6
Bot2.Battlefield = Mox Sapphire; Mox Sapphire; Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Mox Ruby; Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 6
Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Token = true
